                <pb facs="0313" n="225" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg225"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2131/55: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-08-25T12:00:00-05:00">August 25,
                        1933—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 2:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>76. Legation’s 74, August 19, 8 p.m. Miguel López Pumarejo, New York
                    representative of National Federation of Coffee Growers, is being <pb
                        facs="0314" n="226" xml:id="pg226"/> appointed additional adviser. Other
                    experts will arrive New York September 5th S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Santa
                        Maria.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
